 "text": "-->\nLawrence County Treasurer\ntop of page\nLawrence County, Missouri\nYour County Government at Work\nHOME\nANNOUNCEMENTS\nOFFICES\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Commission\nHealth Department\nProsecuting attorney\nEmergency Management\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nELECTIONS\nABOUT\nROADS\nJOBS\nPERMITS\nEnterprise zone\nPlanning & zoning\nLaw Enforcement Center\nLegal Disclaimer - Accessibility\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nOffice of the County Treasurer\nKathy (Seneker) Fairchild\nDeputy Treasurer Steve Wendler\nHistoric Courthouse - 8-4 Mon-Fri - 417-466-2662\n​\nHOME\nANNOUNCEMENTS\nOFFICES\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Commission\nHealth Department\nProsecuting attorney\nEmergency Management\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nELECTIONS\nABOUT\nROADS\nJOBS\nPERMITS\nEnterprise zone\nPlanning & zoning\nLaw Enforcement Center\nLegal Disclaimer - Accessibility\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nDo you have unclaimed property in other states?\nwww.unclaimed.org\nContact:\nTREASURER KATHY (SENEKER) FAIRCHILD\nDEPUTY TREASURER STEVE WENDLER\nP.O. Box 46\nMt. Vernon, MO 65712\n417-466-2662 (fax 417-466-4348)\ntreasurer@lawrencecountymo.gov\nThe County Treasurer handles revenues, distributes tax monies and performs other duties authorized by state statute.\nWe can also help you find out if you have unclaimed money with the state. Perhaps there is interest on an old bank account, a check that wasn’t cashed, or a deposit that didn’t make its way back to you. Click here or contact us and we’ll check our latest database of Lawrence countians with unclaimed funds.\nReturn to home page\nLegal Disclaimer - Accessbility Notice\nbottom of page",
